 "result": {
  "ok": true,
  "title": "Chalk on Church Lane",
  "text": "You went through No. 14 Church Lane, then the Pells’ house next door. Later, the Riverside dam breached. I had chalked a circle with a line through it on No. 14: empty. The list was finished, and I was still holding the chalk. Inside were the kitchen calendar, a piano nobody had tuned since 2020, and eleven boxes I could not carry. I have kept the chalk.\n\nMrs Pell brought shortbread to the wardens’ meetings. She told everyone she had voted against the levy, so nobody would have to wonder. She had a roof to fix that year; I kept her receipt. She came to every drill and chalked her own door. The shortbread tin went with her.",
